url: "https://github.com/mengxj319-creator/phenoharvest-analysis"

license: "MIT"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-13"

abstract: >
  PhenoHarvest is a browser-based toolkit for automated stomatal annotation and spatial pattern analysis.
  It integrates multiple analytical approaches, including Ripley's K function, Moran's I,
  single-image kernel density estimation (KDE), and multi-image mean/standard deviation KDE,
  enabling high-throughput and reproducible analysis of stomatal spatial organization.

keywords:
  - stomata
  - spatial analysis
  - Ripley's K
  - Moran's I
  - KDE
  - browser tool
  - phenotyping